# O10-LISTEN acceptance (independent oracles, written before the implementation exists).
# Every check below is expected to PASS on the finished outcome. On main 2.4.0 (e45d947) many of them fail on purpose:
# main has no mode header, no Twitch categories or paging, the mini layout overlaps its window controls, Rooms clips at 360 px,
# toasts cover the room name, and so on. This list therefore has no "!" known failures: a failing line is a real gap.
# KNOWN FAILURES (!): F1, N1, N5 and N6 are kept running as ORIGINALS, superseded by F1-R1, N1-R1, N5-R1 and N6-R1
# (coordinator 2026-11-21: deferred to O11, reason "deferred to O11"; the originals stay visible as the gaps O11 closes).
!F1 [ORIGINAL, superseded by F1-R1] at first launch something in the window content has the keyboard focus (not nothing, not the header)
F1-R1 a first launch shows a page, starts nothing and does not put the focus on a window-control button
G1 at 360 px the mini layout is showing and its window controls are on screen (precondition)
