H0 plain Listen (music mode) shows no ambience header and no "Play as ambience" buttons
H1 in ambience mode, Listen is the page shown
H2 ... and the header (top band, not the scrolling body) names the mode: it says "ambience"
H3 ... and the header holds a way out (a Back/Cancel/Done/Exit control)
H4 ... while browsing there still plays nothing
H5 the header way out leaves the mode and returns to Now, closed Mix, with nothing sent and the room untouched
H6 ... and the header no longer says it is choosing an ambience
H7 ... and Listen opened again is plain music mode: no ambience header, no "Play as ambience" buttons
H8 from the Mix the header names the mode and offers a way out too
H9 ... and its way out returns to the Mix over Now
H10 going to Rooms ends the mode: the Rooms header shows no ambience text
H11 ... and Listen opened afterwards is music mode again
H12 Escape in ambience mode still leaves it (to Now) and the header returns to normal
H13 Music > Change… while the mode is on opens plain Listen: the mode never survives into it
H14 in ambience mode the offline Sounds rows offer "Play as ambience"
H15 choosing an ambience sends exactly one ambience (atmosphere layer) command, returns to Now and ends the mode
H16 at 560 px the header still names the mode, with a way out, inside the window
