T1 Live channels has category chips Music, ASMR, All and Your channels
T2 the Music chip lists Music channels (and no ASMR ones)
T3 a row shows the channel name, its stream title, its category (Music) and its viewers (1234)
T4 a row has art (a picture or avatar slot), not only a monogram tile
T5 the page loaded the Music category with at most 100 streams per request
T6 "Show more" pages past 60: every one of the 230 Music streams can be reached
T7 ... through the cursors Twitch returned, in order (music-1 then music-2), never an invented one
T8 ... and no channel appears twice
T9 ... and once the last page is in, there is no "Show more" left (and the pages really were fetched)
T10 browsing and paging Twitch sent no command to the room
T11 the ASMR chip shows ASMR streams (the first without any paging), with category ASMR and its 87 viewers, and no Music rows
T12 ... all 45 ASMR streams are reachable and the last page leaves no "Show more"
T13 the All chip reaches every Music and every ASMR stream (230 + 45), once each
T14 (the original bug) ASMR streams are no longer cut off by a 60 channel cap in the merged list
T15 the Your channels chip lists the curated channel and none of the category streams
T16 a page that fails does not drop the rows already shown (still at least 100 Music rows)
T17 ... and asking again fetches the page that failed (all 230 reachable after the retry)
W1 Library rows (on demand) say "Play", never "Tune in"
