R3 a tag match ("rain" in the tags of Calm Mix) ranks above substring noise
R4 a word-start match (Rainbow) ranks above substring noise
R5 within the same kind of match the more popular station stays first (Rain Sounds before Heavy Rain; Ukrainian before Trainspotting)
R6 ranking drops no station and repeats none
